-- Uses the library's own Running and Walking exercises (no new exercises).
-- Safe to run again: fixed ids with ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING, so a second run
-- adds nothing and never overwrites a coach's edits. Nothing here touches a
-- client's program, logs or any existing template.
--
-- Rollback: DELETE FROM public.pl_templates WHERE id IN (the 3 ids below)
-- removes them (clients who were assigned one keep their own copy).


